    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "Imagine the chairs on <i>The Voice</i> malfunction, causing them to spin at potentially lethal speeds.",
      "n": "QuestionText1"
    },
    {
      "s": "Je suis un grand chanteurrrrRRRRrrrrRRRR ",
