    },
    {
      "s": "Although the exact speed changes slightly depending on the latitude, the earth roughly spins at a rate of 1000 mph.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "717067_1",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "And if he spun the opposite direction of the Earth he would go back in time. That’s just science!",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "717068_2",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Imagine the chairs on <i>The Voice</i> malfunction, causing them to spin at potentially lethal speeds. [beat] I mean... imagine it! Anyway... Which judge would be spinning around at the same speed as Earth?",
